{"id":464,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"信仰・希望・愛を軸に共生を学ぶ","feature_description":"玉川聖学院は聖書に基づく教育を行い、「信仰・希望・愛」を大切にしています。教育の柱は、女性としての生き方を考える女子教育、人と共に生きる力を育む人間教育、世界の中で自分の可能性と使命を見つける国際教育です。中等部からの学びを通して、自分と他者の価値に向き合い、社会との関わりを考えることを目指します。他者と共に生きる力を重視します。","clubs":[{"id":9193,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9194,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9195,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9196,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9197,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9198,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9199,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9200,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9201,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9203,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9204,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9205,"name":"ギターマンドリン部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9206,"name":"ウィンドオーケストラ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":9207,"name":"ハンドベル部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://tamasei.ed.jp/tamaseilife/","verified_at":"